      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOLLEY MACALLAN (1) has a strong record this trip with three wins and two placings from nine starts. Missed the frame latest (31.07) when fourth over 530m at this track in a Other. Looks well placed and should feature. DAKOTA MILA (4) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame from Box 7 last run (31.00) at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Bold showing expected. CANYA JUMP (6) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 1.75 lengths win at Murray Bridge in a handy 30.37. Jumping from the pinch draw but has the ability and in winning form. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Can make it two on the bounce. BACARDI GIRL (8) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish from this box.",
